# Data Rules

- All interfaces in src/types/ with descriptive filenames
- Mock data in src/data/mockData.ts as named exports
- Every mock array/object must be typed with its interface
- Use realistic but fictional data (Latin American names, plausible numbers)
- Dates as ISO strings, numbers without formatting (format in components)
